      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Sir Osborne Smith was the first Governor of RBI, while C.D. Deshmukh was the first Indian Governor.",
        "The central office of RBI was initially established in Kolkata and permanently moved to Mumbai in 1937.",
        "One-rupee notes and coins bear the signature of the Finance Secretary, whereas other currency notes bear the RBI Governor's signature."
